# Always slotted. Env key is <16hex>_<KIND>, dummy is pf_<16hex>_<KIND>.
# Never put a live token on the agent. Mint on the Pi:
#
#   sudo pf enroll mint --kind CLAUDE --stdin
#   sudo pf enroll mint --kind ANTHROPIC_API_KEY --stdin
#   sudo pf enroll mint --kind GITHUB_TOKEN --stdin
#
# --stdin reads the token from standard input (CLAUDE: the oat on line one,
# the ort on line two). Paste, then push Ctrl-D. The token does not go into
# a shell argument.
#
# Each mint allots a new 16-hex slot. Claude oat+ort share one slot.
# `apply` migrates leftover unslotted KEY=value rows.
